<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS5" title="In Appendix A Appendix ‣ RoboView-Bias: Benchmarking Visual Bias in Embodied Agents for Robotic Manipulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.5 </span>Implementation details of Semantic Grounding Layer</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
</ol></nav>
